<title>JAPAN: Toho - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toho - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 49.28		vs	   44.13</p>
<p> Operating	  825    million    vs	  670    million</p>
<p> Current	    805    million    vs	  627    million</p>
<p> Net		  337    million    vs	  223    million</p>
